# Real-Time Emotion Recognition and Gender Classification

A complete Python CNN project that performs real-time emotion recognition and gender classification from images and live camera input. The model is designed around a multi-task architecture that predicts:

- 7 emotions
- 2 gender classes

## Project Summary

This project demonstrates a deep learning pipeline that processes images and live camera frames through a single CNN model. A shared feature extractor is used to learn representations from facial images, followed by two output heads:

- emotion classification head: 7 classes
- gender classification head: 2 classes

The system is intended for classroom, research, and prototype deployment scenarios.

## Key Features

- Multi-task CNN architecture
- 7 emotion classes
- 2 gender classes
- Live webcam support using OpenCV
- Static image inference
- Training pipeline with evaluation output
- Model save/load support

